  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "The spelling of Peleg overlaps the common noun and Psalm 65:10 is about a watercourse. The longer words for concubine, steel and the name Pildash have different consonants and no attested derivation here. The two Syriac nouns with the consonants פלגותא are distinct SEDRA lexemes 2523 and 2524."
